Subject: [PATCH] * src/sfnt/ttcolr.c (tt_face_colr_blend_layer): Use
 FT_ALLOC_MULT.

Fixes #1389. The overflow is detected in ft_mem_qrealloc.

Bug: 503556301
Test: TreeHugger
Flag: EXEMPT CVE_FIX
Change-Id: I2a11ad1dcce54a554260935926f7d2c946826369
---
 src/sfnt/ttcolr.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/sfnt/ttcolr.c b/src/sfnt/ttcolr.c
index 281e7135..b4e58fe0 100644
--- a/src/sfnt/ttcolr.c
+++ b/src/sfnt/ttcolr.c
@@ -1803,8 +1803,7 @@
         FT_Byte*  q;
 
 
-        size  = rows * pitch;
-        if ( FT_ALLOC( buf, size ) )
+        if ( FT_ALLOC_MULT( buf, rows, pitch ) )
           return error;
 
         p = dstSlot->bitmap.buffer;
